# drawn from an installed icon theme (Adwaita, Papirus, Breeze…) instead. Each
# Material name maps to freedesktop / Adwaita names to try; `icons map THEME`
# looks them up through the theme and what it inherits (hicolor last), the
# "-symbolic" ones first (one color, so the shell tints them), and prints
# {material: {p: path, s: symbolic}}. Names a theme lacks stay Material Symbols.

